21-01-15\', \'event\': \'Hopital des Enfants formalizes accommodation at Maison de l’Avenir with a new procedure for selecting and evaluating housing requests.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-01-28\', \'event\': \'Launch of the anti-COVID-19 vaccination campaign for all CHUIS personnel at Hopital Ibn Sina.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02\', \'event\': \'Ceremonie de reconnaissance in honor of personnel who contributed to satisfying user complaints at Hopital des Enfants.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-17\', \'event\': \'Courtesy visit of Madame Sandrine LELONG-MOTTA, Consul General of France in Rabat, to the CHUIS Directorate to discuss bilateral health cooperation.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-17\', \'event\': \'Partnership agreement signed between CHU Ibn Sina and Fundacion Privada Instituto de Salud Global Barcelona to improve child health, including a specific agreement for meningitis detection in Morocco.\'}, {\'date_start\': \'2021-03-01\', \'date_end\': \'2021-04-09\', \'event\': \'CHUIS professors supervised medical simulation learning sessions for 150 internal doctors at the Faculty of Medicine and Pharmacy of Rabat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-13\', \'event\': \'First meeting of the Strategic Coordination Committee (CCS) for the Rabat-Sale-Kenitra Regional Medical Program (PMR) 2021-2025, marking its launch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'event\': \'Partnership agreement signed with Novo Nordisk Pharma for personalized care of hemophilia patients, including an IT system for data collection, a biometric card, and educational materials.\'}, {\'date_start\': \'2021-04-20\', \'date_end\': \'2021-06-02\', \'event\': \'Training on certification of causes of death organized by CHU Ibn Sina in collaboration with the Ministry of Health, for internal doctors, residents, and general supervisors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04\', \'event\': \'New external consultation and interventional rheumatology pavilion opened at Hopital Al Ayachi after renovation.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-05-04\', \'event\': \'Meeting of the Steering Committee for the Rabat-Sale-Kenitra Regional Medical Program (PMR) to present 245 projects for adapting healthcare services.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-05-11\', \'event\': \'Second meeting of the Strategic Coordination Committee for the Rabat-Sale-Kenitra Regional Medical Program (PMR) to synthesize projects and proposals for 5 priority sectors.\'}, {\'date_start\': \'2021-05-17\', \'date_end\': \'2021-05-21\', \'event\': \'CHU Ibn Sina participated in the 18th Week of the Francophonie Mother-Child Network (RMEF) with 5 workshops and 10 posters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-05-28\', \'event\': \"Reception of His Excellency Mr. Li CHANGLIN, Ambassador of the People\'s Republic of China to Morocco, for a visit to the COVID-19 vaccination site at Hopital Ibn Sina.\"}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-21\', \'event\': \'New reception and billing structure inaugurated at Hopital de Maternite et Sante Reproductrice les Orangers (HMSRO).\'}, {\'date_start\': \'2021-06-22\', \'date_end\': \'2021-06-29\', \'event\': \'Training workshops on expenditure liquidation and ordering procedures organized by the Financial Affairs Division (DAF) for over 80 accounting staff.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-25\', \'event\': \'Hopital Moulay Youssef organized an awareness meeting on the harms of smoking for World No Tobacco Day.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-30\', \'event\': \'Scientific meeting on hospital pharmacy management held at Hopital Al Ayachi.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-07\', \'event\': \'Official dissemination of the 2nd version of the procedure for receiving and processing complaints at the CHUIS Directorate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-14\', \'event\': \'Commissions worked on constructing priority care pathways for the Rabat-Sale-Kenitra Regional Medical Program (PMR) 2021-2025.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-27\', \'event\': \'Framework partnership agreement signed with Mohammed V University of Rabat (UM5R) focusing on medical research.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-14\', \'event\': \'Two framework partnership agreements signed with CHU de Kigali and King Faisal Hospital in Rwanda.\'}, {\'date_start\': \'2021-09-15\', \'date_end\': \'2021-10-06\', \'event\': \'Two Mauritanian delegations from the general inspection visited CHUIS to learn about its internal audit and management control experience.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-17\', \'event\': \'Partnership agreement signed with CHU de Kamenge in Burundi for expertise exchange and staff training.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-17\', \'event\': \'Framework partnership agreement signed with the National Institute of Hygiene (INH) to promote training and scientific research.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-17\', \'event\': \'Pr. Abdelkader ERROUGANI participated in the opening session of academic meetings, where teams from Hopital des Specialites ophthalmology service received excellence awards for scientific research.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09\', \'event\': \'New NIMS bone-anchored implant technique performed by an ORL team at Hopital des Specialites, with 5 patients benefiting from the surgery.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09\', \'event\': \'Acquisition of a new generation Cone-Beam device for the radiology service at Hopital des Specialites (HS), the second such device at CHU.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-10-04\', \'event\': \'Administration of the 3rd booster dose of the anti-COVID-19 vaccine began at Hopital Ibn Sina for healthcare professionals and fully vaccinated individuals.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-10-01\', \'event\': \'CHUIS joined the St Jude Global Alliance program to improve survival rates for children with cancer and other serious diseases.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-11-16\', \'event\': \'Meeting held to discuss the progress of the electronic hemophilia database project at Hopital des Enfants, in partnership with Novo Nordisk Pharma.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-11-25\', \'event\': \'Elections held for personnel representatives to the CHUIS Board of Directors. 6 representatives elected for medical staff, 2 for nurses/health technicians, and 1 for oth